            <h2 class="pipe">Our Construction Process</h2>
            <p>Every successful project begins with careful planning and clear communication. At S. Phaneuf & Associates, we follow a proven process that helps ensure quality workmanship and an exceptional customer experience from start to finish.</p>

            <h3>1. Consultation & Project Discovery</h3>
            <p>We begin by discussing your goals, budget, timeline, and project requirements. Whether you're planning a new patio, driveway, excavation project, or commercial snow management contract, we take the time to understand your needs.</p>

            <h3>2. Planning & Design</h3>
            <p> Our team evaluates your property and develops a construction plan that prioritizes functionality, durability, and long-term performance. We help clients make informed decisions about materials, layouts, and construction methods.</p>

            <h3>3. Construction & Installation</h3>
            <p>Once construction begins, our experienced crews perform the work with attention to detail and a commitment to quality craftsmanship. Proper site preparation and professional installation are essential components of every project we complete.</p>

            <h3>4. Final Walkthrough & Project Completion</h3>
            <p>Before considering a project complete, we perform a final walkthrough to ensure every detail meets our high standards and your expectations.</p>
